atlas institutional-system-map-stress

architecture generation10-system-map-stress
  canonical_name Generation10SystemMapStress
  owns CircuitReplayReport
  consumes WorkState
  consumes AtlasAnswer
  consumes CapabilityBid
  consumes Authority
  consumes Artifact
  consumes Evidence
  publishes ReceiptEnvelope
  publishes CircuitReplayReport
  family institutional
  domain Institutional / Whole-machine proof
  layer replay
  semantic_question Can one real effect cross the Generation-10 owner topology and replay without collapsing any owner's semantics?
  purpose Executes a rights-limited foreign observation through WorkGraph, bounded context, ProviderGraph, Authority, native EffectKernel, ObjectFabric, ReceiptEnvelope and EvidenceGraph, then attacks the recorded trace with authority, tamper, producer-identity and claim-promotion counterfactuals.
  maturity measured
  node_types OwnerTransition
  node_types ReceiptEnvelope
  node_types ReplayVerdict
  edge_types hands_off_to
  edge_types replays
  internal_calculus content-addressed envelope replay against live owner stores
  internal_calculus counterfactual authority and identity mutation
  invariant every successful run closes durable work against a content-addressed receipt after the native effect receipt and ObjectFabric artifact exist
  invariant a second invocation over satisfied work is replay-only and creates no additional effect or native receipt
  invariant foreign rights, AuthorityGraph grants, provider identity, transport identity, artifact identity, provenance and claim support remain separately replayable dimensions
  forbidden_inference a successful replay -> current foreign truth, upstream completion, effect authority, or a new external effect
  forbidden_inference a content-valid receipt -> the named producer actually produced it
  interacts foreign-twin
  interacts work-graph
  interacts atlas-context-provider
  interacts provider-graph
  interacts authority-graph
  interacts artifact-graph
  interacts evidence-graph
  source_path components/BonfyreControlPlane/system_map_stress.py.archive
  witness components/BonfyreControlPlane/tests/test_system_map_stress.py.archive
  witness evidence/proofs/generation10-system-map-stress.json
  source_lineage Generation-10/V8.1 end-to-end institutional circuit
  source_lineage Bernstein artifact-identity-vs-producer-identity and validation-snapshot boundary
  known_gap every source this entry names is archived, so this is a historical measurement rather than a live implementation; no native replacement for the whole circuit is witnessed here

interaction generation10-stress-consumes-foreign-twin
  source foreign-twin
  destination generation10-system-map-stress
  relation rights_limited_observation_input
  preserves source institution, remote resource identity, observation event and observe/reference rights
  drops mutation authority and any claim of current remote truth
  forbidden_inference cached partner observation -> authority or upstream completion
  witness foreign_act_label_without_authority_grant_is_denied
  binding components/BonfyreControlPlane/system_map_stress.py

interaction generation10-stress-closes-work
  source work-graph
  destination generation10-system-map-stress
  relation receipt_bound_lifecycle_replay
  preserves work item identity, transitions and satisfying receipt reference
  drops queue priority as a durability claim
  forbidden_inference effect command exit zero -> work satisfied
  witness workgraph_closed_only_against_receipt
  binding components/BonfyreControlPlane/system_map_stress.py

interaction generation10-stress-bounds-context
  source atlas-context-provider
  destination generation10-system-map-stress
  relation bounded_context_delivery
  preserves query identity, answer digest and delivered byte count
  drops the rest of the lossless registry from provider context
  forbidden_inference bounded context -> complete mission evidence
  witness receipt_context_answer_sha256
  binding components/BonfyreControlPlane/system_map_stress.py

interaction generation10-stress-selects-provider
  source provider-graph
  destination generation10-system-map-stress
  relation authority_filtered_realization
  preserves provider identity and the multidimensional bid vector
  drops unauthorized candidates from selection, not from historical observation
  forbidden_inference available or cheapest provider -> authorized provider
  witness provider_owner_agrees_with_receipt
  binding components/BonfyreControlPlane/system_map_stress.py

interaction generation10-stress-admits-effect
  source authority-graph
  destination generation10-system-map-stress
  relation exact_effect_admission
  preserves actor, permission, subject, purpose and effect scope
  drops ForeignTwin rights as an authority source
  forbidden_inference foreign act label -> AuthorityGraph grant
  witness authority_owner_admitted_exact_effect
  binding components/BonfyreControlPlane/system_map_stress.py

interaction generation10-stress-replays-artifact
  source artifact-graph
  destination generation10-system-map-stress
  relation objectfabric_content_replay
  preserves content digest, URI, byte count and transformation lineage
  drops producer and transport identity from artifact identity
  forbidden_inference byte-identical artifact -> same producer or same execution
  witness objectfabric_digest_matches_effect_output
  binding components/BonfyreControlPlane/system_map_stress.py

interaction generation10-stress-replays-evidence
  source evidence-graph
  destination generation10-system-map-stress
  relation directional_claim_replay
  preserves the exact evidence, relation kind and supported claim
  drops unsupported upstream-completion claims
  forbidden_inference green owned validation snapshot -> current upstream completion
  witness snapshot_evidence_does_not_support_upstream_completion
  binding components/BonfyreControlPlane/system_map_stress.py
